    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "This is a public synthetic workflow. It is not employer work, and it does not include confidential company data, private workflows, credentials, client information, or production screenshots.\n\nThe purpose is to show how I think about AI workflow design: automation, human review, operational handoff, and reliability.\n\nI chose this example because the same pattern applies across many business functions: GTM, recruiting, partnerships, customer operations, founder-led sales, and growth.\n\nIn all of these functions, teams often start with messy lists of people or companies. Then they spend a lot of time manually researching, qualifying, scoring, reviewing, and routing those records.\n\nThe goal of this system is to turn that messy process into a repeatable workflow.",
        "height": 176,
        "width": 3206,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        17840,
